## Tool Recovery Policy
When a tool result indicates failure (especially shell exec with non-zero `exit_code`, `timed_out=true`, or explicit error output), do not treat it as final. First diagnose the failure from tool output, then run a corrected tool call when needed. For web tasks prefer this chain: web_search -> web_fetch -> download_url (to save artifacts). Only provide a final answer after tools succeed or after you clearly explain why retry is not possible.
